// The prenuptial agreement of Elena Vargas and Tomas Reed (prenup.md).
Document "prenup.md".

Fact person Identified by Elena, Tomas
Fact asset
Param term : Duration = 3650

// What each party owns, and how it came to them
Function owner Identified by asset * person
Function worth Identified by asset * amount : USD
Fact premarital Identified by asset
Fact by-gift Identified by asset
Event acquires Related to person, asset, amount : USD
  Creates owner(asset, person), worth(asset, amount)
Event receives-gift Related to person, asset, amount : USD
  Syncs with acquires(person, asset, amount)
  Creates by-gift(asset)
Event wedding
  Creates (Foreach owner: premarital(owner.asset) When owner)

// N.1 Signing and disclosure
Fact listed Identified by asset
Fact concealed Identified by person
Act list Actor person Related to asset
  Holds when owner(asset, person) && !Done(sign(person))
  Creates listed(asset)
Act sign Actor person
  Holds when True
  Creates concealed(person) When (Exists asset: owner(asset, person) && !listed(asset))

// N.6 Term
Bool in-force
  Holds when (Forall person: Done(sign(person))) && !(Exists person: concealed(person))
          && (!Done(wedding()) || Age(wedding()) < term)
Event divorce

// N.2 to N.4 What is marital
Fact mixed Identified by asset
Act put-in-joint-account Actor person Related to asset
  Holds when owner(asset, person)
  Creates mixed(asset)
Fact marital Identified by asset
  Default owned-before Rejects when premarital(asset)
  Default acquired-during Holds when !premarital(asset) && (Exists person: owner(asset, person))
  Exception gift-or-inheritance Overrides acquired-during Rejects when by-gift(asset)
  Exception mixing Overrides owned-before, gift-or-inheritance Holds when mixed(asset)

// N.5 Divorce
Amount pool : USD Is Sum(Foreach asset: worth(asset) When marital(asset))
Fact kept Identified by person * asset
Fact awarded Identified by person * amount : USD
Power keep Actor person Related to asset
  Holds when Done(divorce()) && owner(asset, person) && !marital(asset)
  Valid when (in-force At divorce()) && owner(asset, person) && !marital(asset)
  Creates kept(person, asset)
Power take-half Actor person
  Holds when Done(divorce())
  Valid when in-force At divorce()
  Creates awarded(person, MulDivRound(pool, 1, 2, Floor))

Clause N.1/1 => list
Clause N.1/2 => sign, in-force
Clause N.1/3 => concealed, in-force, keep, take-half
Clause N.2/1 => wedding, premarital, owned-before
Clause N.2/2 => receives-gift, by-gift, gift-or-inheritance
Clause N.3 => acquires, acquired-during
Clause N.4 => put-in-joint-account, mixing
Clause N.5/1 => divorce, keep
Clause N.5/2 => pool, take-half
Clause N.6 => term, in-force, keep, take-half.
